# 🩺 Sugar Scan

Sugar Scan is a machine learning-based diabetes risk prediction web application.

🌐 Live Demo: https://relaxed-caramel-9c918f.netlify.app/

## 🚀 Features

- Diabetes risk prediction using Machine Learning
- Client-side prediction (No backend required)
- Fast and privacy-focused
- Simple user interface
- Model runs directly in the browser

## 🧠 Machine Learning Workflow

1. Data preprocessing
2. Feature standardization

\[
z = \frac{x-\mu}{\sigma}
\]

3. Train/Test split:
- 80% Training
- 20% Testing

4. Model training
5. Export trained model parameters

Generated model:

## 📊 Model Evaluation

Models are evaluated using:

- Accuracy
- Precision
- Recall
- F1 Score
- Confusion Matrix

